    "description": "Objective\n\nA working Rep persona in the sandbox so functionality can be demoed and tested exactly as a Rep experiences it.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\n* Create or update a Rep profile suitable for demo/UAT\n\n* Assign the correct permission sets / permission set groups\n\n* Document the configuration required for a Rep to see and use the Sign-Up console\n\n* Flow User checkbox must be ticked on the user record for Sign-Up buttons to render\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\n* Logging in as the Rep persona reproduces the intended Rep experience end to end\n\n* Configuration steps are written down and repeatable\n\nProgress\n\n* Jared set up with the three permission set groups as an interim measure. Access needs a cleanup pass after the demo.\n\nAdditional Notes\n\nInterim to BUILD-01 (four-tier permission model). This must NOT become the permission model — reconcile before go-live.\n\nSTATUS: In Progress.\n\nSource: Wagertech Additional User Stories, July 2026 — item 15.",
